*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0001
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-03-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 161
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0001.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 WS-CSCR            PIC 9(3).
    *> DEBT TO INCOME RATIO
    05 WS-DTI             PIC 9V99.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 DC-CD              PIC X VALUE 'D'.
        88 DC-REFERRED VALUE 'R'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CREDIT-CUTOFF
    DISPLAY "DC-CD=" DC-CD
    STOP RUN.
CREDIT-CUTOFF.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-CSCR >= 740 AND WS-DTI < 0.43
            MOVE 'A' TO DC-CD
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER
        WHEN WS-CSCR >= 620
            SET DC-REFERRED TO TRUE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'D' TO DC-CD
    END-EVALUATE.
